            r2_assumed_1: `Reach: the simulator assumes every shopper knows and can find the Hiri; a new brand reaches 55–70% in its first season (industry association). The launch run is set as a percentage of the study’s raw forecast.`,
            r2_bias_autoexplicado: `Your method overstates purchase and underweights price: the raw forecast will run high and willingness to pay will be generous.`,
