            r4_brief: `The 2029 Tornell brings 120 km for €2,190. Battery cells are ordered in January for the whole year (16-week lead time): what you plan is what you can build, and every bicycle left at the end of the year costs €300. Update to the main model: +30 km of range (€140, +1 kg); a frame 2 kg lighter (€40); integrated GPS anti-theft (€90); €200 off the price; or no change. Production plan: recalibrate the simulator with September–December demand and the confirmed reach (€20,000); the same with a 15% buffer; repeat for twelve months the average monthly sales of April–August; or build what the dealers pre-order.`,
